e task was accomplished: the storm news (Storm Austen) was found in the BBC Weather section, and the response correctly indicates where (southern England, Wales, south-west landfall) and when (overnight Thursday into Friday) the severe weather occurred, consistent with the article content shown in the screenshots.\n\n**Verdict: SUCCESS**",
